WEBVTT

00:04.630 --> 00:08.250
Ultimatia has never had
a combat-oriented approach.

00:08.500 --> 00:12.880
To her, battles are just empty undertakings,
and contests of strength are savage.

00:12.880 --> 00:18.330
At the same time, she had utmost confidence
in her own Time Control Magic.

00:19.750 --> 00:26.170
She was secure in her belief that her power
can thwart all shows of brute force.

00:26.630 --> 00:30.250
However, that security she felt
has been shattered.

00:30.630 --> 00:33.330
Ragna smashed it to bits.

00:35.130 --> 00:37.960
Right now, she's not the Winged Monarch.

00:37.960 --> 00:41.080
She's merely a woman petrified of battle.

00:42.670 --> 00:46.210
What will you do now, mere mortal?

00:46.210 --> 00:50.540
If you want to dispose of your foe,
now is your only chance.

00:50.540 --> 00:52.750
How is he moving?

00:52.750 --> 00:55.330
Is there some fault in
my magic's formulation?

00:55.330 --> 00:57.040
Or is it the way I use it?

00:57.040 --> 00:58.500
Lady Ultimatia!

00:58.500 --> 01:00.710
Could it be a shortcoming of
Time Control Magic itself?

01:00.710 --> 01:02.000
Lady Ultimatia!

01:02.000 --> 01:03.670
Should I use it again?

01:03.670 --> 01:06.170
But I don't understand what the issue is.

01:06.170 --> 01:07.920
Lady Ultimatia!
If it's ineffective again...<b></b>

01:08.790 --> 01:10.750
H-heed me, creation!

01:10.750 --> 01:12.000
And fall still!

01:12.000 --> 01:13.040
Ooh.

01:13.040 --> 01:15.080
I'm surprised by your spunk.

01:15.080 --> 01:17.830
In that case, let's break you down more.

01:20.920 --> 01:21.880
Huh?

01:23.580 --> 01:25.540
What? This cannot be...

01:25.540 --> 01:28.500
Why would you... do this?

01:35.330 --> 01:36.380
Wh...

01:37.460 --> 01:41.880
What in the world is going on?

01:43.210 --> 01:47.460
<b>Episode 8: A Painful Blow</b>

01:46.830 --> 01:48.040
Pain.

01:48.380 --> 01:49.710
Rancor.

01:49.710 --> 01:51.130
Anguish.

01:51.130 --> 01:52.170
Anxiety.

01:52.170 --> 01:53.460
Despair.

01:53.460 --> 01:54.630
Death.

01:56.540 --> 01:58.330
This is destruction.

01:58.920 --> 02:04.920
I have exposed what lies behind
the mask of your false "compassion."

02:05.540 --> 02:06.750
Behold!

02:06.750 --> 02:08.130
And listen!

02:08.130 --> 02:09.080
Help...

02:09.080 --> 02:11.630
The screams of parents who lost their children!

02:11.630 --> 02:13.960
The sobs of children who lost their parents!

02:13.960 --> 02:18.420
Now, here is everything you wanted
to sweep under the rug!

02:18.420 --> 02:21.750
At most, tens of thousands of people
died from the explosions.

02:21.750 --> 02:25.380
But as time goes on,
that number will climb even higher!

02:29.920 --> 02:33.830
Now what will you do,
oh-so-compassionate Dragon Monarch?

02:33.830 --> 02:36.080
Help me!

02:38.040 --> 02:41.290
If you want to save these poor people,

02:41.290 --> 02:43.540
use it! Use it!

02:43.540 --> 02:47.000
There is only one way to save them!

02:48.960 --> 02:51.500
Heed me, creation, and retu-

02:51.500 --> 02:54.130
Anything but that, Lady Ultimatia!

02:54.130 --> 02:58.130
If you rewind the world now,
you'll deplete all your magical power!

02:58.130 --> 03:00.000
You'll play right into the enemy's hands!

03:00.000 --> 03:02.580
You absolutely should not rewind!

03:02.880 --> 03:05.040
Please endure this!

03:06.170 --> 03:07.330
Tsk!

03:08.460 --> 03:10.710
Chimera, we're withdrawing.

03:10.710 --> 03:11.830
Yes, Master.

03:16.330 --> 03:18.960
Then what should I do?

03:19.170 --> 03:23.080
So many people are suffering and dying...

03:24.330 --> 03:27.330
Is there nothing I can do?

03:27.920 --> 03:29.960
This devastation is their fate.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.790
It is the will of God.

03:32.250 --> 03:35.210
It is necessary for the new world.

03:35.920 --> 03:40.380
But I just wanted to prevent their suffering...

03:41.210 --> 03:44.790
At least, that's what I hoped to do...

03:51.500 --> 03:54.580
Someone help, please!

03:54.750 --> 03:57.210
My child is trapped under some rubble!

03:57.210 --> 03:58.290
Someone!
My legs! My legs!<b></b>

03:58.290 --> 03:59.250
My legs! My legs!

03:59.250 --> 04:00.880
Help me!

04:01.170 --> 04:02.290
Ahh, the pain!

04:02.290 --> 04:04.130
No, I don't wanna die!

04:07.830 --> 04:10.040
Nice work today, Master!

04:10.040 --> 04:13.420
I prepared a door just like you ordered.

04:13.420 --> 04:16.000
You killed it out there, Lady Veronica!

04:16.000 --> 04:19.500
When it comes to wrongdoing,
no one is on par with you.

04:19.500 --> 04:21.830
That staggering level of cruelty
made me accidently-

04:23.500 --> 04:26.880
The big clock tower on Merue Street
in the Old District.

04:26.880 --> 04:30.500
I know I also ordered you
to plant a bomb there.

04:30.880 --> 04:34.750
There also weren't enough explosions
on the castle walls. Why?

04:36.290 --> 04:38.540
Oh my, I apologize!

04:38.540 --> 04:41.040
There are lots of businesses in
that area I enjoy visiting, and-

04:42.920 --> 04:46.040
The value of life changes
based on the situation.

04:46.040 --> 04:49.500
Just earlier was the moment when
the lives of the citizens of Lese

04:49.500 --> 04:51.750
were at their greatest value.

04:51.750 --> 04:55.330
If the devastation had been
more sensational and fatal,

04:55.330 --> 04:58.710
Ultimatia might've rewound time!

04:58.710 --> 05:00.380
What a waste!

05:00.380 --> 05:02.750
Don't ever make me play my cards for nothing!

05:04.380 --> 05:05.880
This will not happen again.

05:05.880 --> 05:07.630
Don't forget that.

05:08.000 --> 05:09.880
I'm deeply sorry about this.

05:11.380 --> 05:13.710
I'm sorry, Master Crimson.

05:13.710 --> 05:15.960
I did plant those bombs.

05:16.330 --> 05:19.210
I issued the stop signal.

05:19.580 --> 05:21.920
I wanted to see your reaction.

05:22.500 --> 05:25.790
Suddenly changing plans,
taking big risks,

05:25.790 --> 05:29.420
and potentially saving
more people if we succeed...

05:30.210 --> 05:32.500
I thought it wasn't like you.

05:32.920 --> 05:39.170
I wondered if meeting that human
had changed you in some way.

05:39.960 --> 05:42.040
My worry was unfounded.

05:42.040 --> 05:45.580
You're still the same old boss
you've always been!

05:54.920 --> 05:57.540
Golem. Stay here.

05:57.540 --> 05:59.210
Dispose of that body.

05:59.630 --> 06:02.960
Monitor the bloodline's subsequent
movements in your Base Form.

06:02.960 --> 06:07.040
No way! Staying in a place like this
in my Base Form isn't a task,

06:07.040 --> 06:09.210
it's just punishment!

06:09.210 --> 06:10.210
I'm not doing that!

06:10.210 --> 06:12.750
I do not need a tool that tests its master.

06:12.750 --> 06:14.960
Go ahead and endure suffering
tantamount to death.

06:17.790 --> 06:19.290
He figured me out.

06:28.960 --> 06:31.460
What have I accomplished in this battle?

06:32.460 --> 06:34.960
I'm powerless. I'm worthless.

06:35.500 --> 06:37.210
I didn't do anything.

06:38.330 --> 06:39.830
I couldn't do anything.

06:41.500 --> 06:43.790
Maturation?

06:44.250 --> 06:45.580
That's right.

06:45.580 --> 06:49.210
That's when one is not yet a
full-fledged member of the bloodline.

06:49.210 --> 06:54.040
It's the period when one is still
adapting to our progenitor's blood.

06:54.380 --> 06:56.420
In short, they're immature.

06:58.670 --> 07:02.880
The Blood of the Wing refers to them
as the Thirteenth Seat.

07:02.880 --> 07:05.830
The shortness of this maturation period
is also a rough measurement

07:05.830 --> 07:10.170
of one's potential as a
member of the bloodline.

07:10.630 --> 07:12.920
Olto Zora took one year.

07:12.920 --> 07:15.210
Disas Trois took a single month.

07:15.210 --> 07:18.210
Kamui took less than two days.

07:18.210 --> 07:20.830
And you, Nebulim...

07:21.330 --> 07:24.790
You didn't have a maturation period at all.

07:25.250 --> 07:31.630
Your sheer aptitude as a member of our
bloodline exceeds even that of Woltekamui.

07:32.000 --> 07:34.580
Eventually, you'll become
the bloodline's backbone

07:34.580 --> 07:38.000
and the primary supporter
of our progenitor.

07:38.000 --> 07:41.630
You should be well-aware of this
and take pride in it.

07:42.380 --> 07:46.040
Know and take pride in the fact
I'll be the backbone of the bloodline?

07:46.040 --> 07:48.710
There's no way I can believe that.

07:49.130 --> 07:51.420
I couldn't protect Lady Ultimatia.

07:51.420 --> 07:53.670
I only got myself hurt...

07:54.170 --> 07:56.540
I'm supposed to have
the aptitude to surpass Kamui?

07:56.540 --> 07:59.710
This would've never happened
if he were here now.

08:00.170 --> 08:03.170
I have to be strong now!
Otherwise, I'm useless!

08:14.250 --> 08:15.750
You won't get away!

08:15.750 --> 08:17.880
I'll find you!

08:18.130 --> 08:19.580
Nebulim...

08:19.580 --> 08:23.580
I know he has excellent potential
as a member of the bloodline.

08:23.580 --> 08:26.080
Am I getting a glimpse of
that potential now?

08:26.080 --> 08:29.750
He senses I'm in another spatial realm
and is looking for me.

08:30.790 --> 08:35.170
Of course, Barrier Magic is
an inferior type of Spatial Magic.

08:35.170 --> 08:37.630
It's not strange he noticed me,
in and of itself.

08:37.630 --> 08:41.210
But he'll be unable to find me.

08:41.210 --> 08:45.920
I crafted this Globe Chamber
during my heyday.

08:45.920 --> 08:48.830
It's a gate connected to
every part of the world.

08:48.830 --> 08:53.420
It is the foundation of my secret
maneuvering around the world.

08:53.420 --> 08:56.250
Your power has grown somewhat,

08:56.250 --> 08:59.750
but don't think you can touch me
for a second, boy.

09:00.250 --> 09:02.460
The world is not that simple.

09:02.460 --> 09:05.630
Even if by some chance he ferrets me out,

09:05.630 --> 09:09.330
it's impossible to break through
its protection using outside forces.

09:09.830 --> 09:12.130
Call the Lunar Base.

09:12.630 --> 09:16.500
Things didn't go according to plan,
but the outcome exceeded my expectations.

09:17.210 --> 09:19.710
In light of this, I'll begin preparations
for the next few years.

09:20.170 --> 09:23.420
There is no longer anything for me
to do in this country.

09:23.830 --> 09:25.170
We're leaving.

09:33.670 --> 09:35.710
It ran away.

09:36.170 --> 09:39.880
I don't think it can fly away
since we gave its wing a serious wound.

09:40.380 --> 09:43.580
But there's still a lot of time until dawn.

09:43.580 --> 09:44.790
Hmm...

09:45.830 --> 09:48.630
So be it. Let's chase after it!

09:48.630 --> 09:50.710
W-wait, Leo.

09:50.710 --> 09:53.040
There might be a whole horde.

09:53.040 --> 09:54.670
They might ambush us.

09:54.670 --> 09:58.040
Yeah, I guess that could happen.

09:58.040 --> 10:00.000
But in this particular situation,

10:00.000 --> 10:07.670
I think chancing some danger now
might be best.

10:07.670 --> 10:10.670
There are individual differences
between dragons, just like humans.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.330
That medial dragon had good intuition.

10:12.330 --> 10:15.420
Something like that can get pretty nasty
if it lives long enough.

10:15.420 --> 10:18.460
D-do you mean it could become
a superior dragon?

10:18.460 --> 10:22.210
Hmm, even I couldn't say.

10:23.830 --> 10:28.710
At any rate, it's careless
to think we're the only ones

10:28.710 --> 10:32.380
who can prepare and
get stronger in the future, right?

10:32.830 --> 10:37.040
Personally, I think it'd be fun to
face off with a superior dragon,

10:37.040 --> 10:40.830
but letting it wreak havoc just 'cuz
I think it'd be fun to fight

10:40.830 --> 10:42.830
probably isn't a good reason.

10:43.170 --> 10:47.670
So let's hunt our targets
when the opportunity presents itself!

10:53.130 --> 10:55.380
I'm not... leaving.

10:59.790 --> 11:02.000
I'm not... leaving yet.

11:03.790 --> 11:06.250
I didn't hunt Ultimatia.

11:08.170 --> 11:10.250
I'm not leaving.

11:10.710 --> 11:11.920
I'm going back!

11:11.920 --> 11:13.540
Hey, whoa there.

11:13.830 --> 11:16.000
I know this place.

11:16.000 --> 11:18.000
This is the teleportation room.

11:18.000 --> 11:18.960
Let me out!

11:18.960 --> 11:20.420
I'm going back!

11:20.750 --> 11:21.920
Calm down.

11:22.330 --> 11:24.170
The battle is over.

11:24.170 --> 11:25.960
You did a good job.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.880
The results were superb.

11:28.750 --> 11:31.290
You're stronger than I anticipated.

11:31.290 --> 11:32.830
I'm content!

11:34.880 --> 11:38.040
The pathetic way that woman panicked...

11:39.670 --> 11:41.880
Just the thought of it makes me laugh.

11:41.880 --> 11:43.920
Really, you did a great job.

11:43.920 --> 11:46.670
Now get some rest.
Or I'll have your head.

11:47.040 --> 11:49.380
She's still alive!

11:49.380 --> 11:51.380
I don't give a shit if you're content!

11:51.380 --> 11:53.290
Don't give me that creepy look!

11:54.210 --> 11:58.170
I won't allow her the luxury of living
another single second!

11:58.170 --> 11:59.880
I've made up my mind!

11:59.880 --> 12:01.040
I'm going back!

12:01.040 --> 12:03.000
Silverine Battle Arts!

12:04.170 --> 12:05.750
Ch-Chimera!

12:09.830 --> 12:12.500
You tried using freakin'
Silverine Battle Arts?

12:12.500 --> 12:15.210
You imbecile!

12:15.630 --> 12:20.540
Even you won't get away with
damaging this chamber!

12:20.540 --> 12:22.250
Don't try anything else!

12:22.250 --> 12:24.170
Go to sleep like a good boy!

12:24.170 --> 12:25.170
Tsk!

12:25.170 --> 12:27.630
The chamber has a small crack now.

12:27.630 --> 12:29.880
Silverine Battle Arts and
alternate dimensions don't mix.

12:30.290 --> 12:31.500
I need to expel it now...

12:31.500 --> 12:33.170
I found the enemy!

12:35.330 --> 12:36.460
What?

12:36.460 --> 12:38.130
Seriously?

12:38.330 --> 12:40.330
He found me!

12:40.330 --> 12:42.000
Just from that one crack!

12:42.000 --> 12:44.250
I'll destroy that barrier and drag you out!

12:45.210 --> 12:46.460
It won't open?

12:46.460 --> 12:49.960
The stress from both the outside
and inside made the door warp?

12:50.710 --> 12:54.960
You little idiot, devoting yourself
to someone like Ultimatia.

12:55.290 --> 12:58.920
You dare blemish my arcane artistry!

13:00.080 --> 13:03.960
Know your place, you brat!

13:04.170 --> 13:05.460
Golem!

13:05.460 --> 13:07.380
Kill them!

13:11.000 --> 13:12.880
Nebulim...

13:14.920 --> 13:16.880
Elder!

13:24.130 --> 13:26.130
I can't restrain him!

13:26.580 --> 13:27.630
Hey...

13:29.670 --> 13:31.880
There's no way I'll let you get away!

13:31.880 --> 13:34.130
I'll never let you get away!

13:34.130 --> 13:35.790
You've gotta be shitting me.

13:35.790 --> 13:39.580
I'll make sure every last one of you gets...

13:40.000 --> 13:41.330
killed!
hunted!<b></b>

13:42.460 --> 13:44.420
The hell's going on?

13:44.880 --> 13:48.710
Why is it you're...

13:48.710 --> 13:52.250
helping the enemy ruin my plan?

13:52.250 --> 13:54.250
You numskull!

14:09.830 --> 14:11.420
Night is coming.

14:12.630 --> 14:15.380
Then it will be our turn.

14:22.580 --> 14:24.420
Yes, I know.

14:24.960 --> 14:28.460
There will not be peace
even after the war is over.

14:28.460 --> 14:30.000
It will be more brutal.

14:30.000 --> 14:32.290
There will be many saddening things.

14:32.710 --> 14:33.960
Even so,

14:34.380 --> 14:38.000
I'd like to keep living,
if I'm with everyone else.

14:39.750 --> 14:41.460
I'm dreaming.

14:42.630 --> 14:46.880
Will you feel the same way as me one day,

14:46.880 --> 14:48.290
Crimson?

14:49.040 --> 14:50.920
It's a meaningless dream.

14:50.920 --> 14:53.630
One that happened long ago.

14:57.960 --> 15:01.380
<b>March 8th, Year 498, Age of the Sun</b>

14:59.210 --> 15:02.460
The battle against Dornea was nine days ago.

15:01.790 --> 15:05.210
<b>Northeast Lese, Military Training Ground</b>

15:02.460 --> 15:05.210
We took refuge here five days ago.

15:05.500 --> 15:08.710
I thought they would attack tonight.

15:10.960 --> 15:15.290
But the killing intent of the dragons
in this area was suddenly disturbed.

15:15.290 --> 15:17.920
What happened to the superior dragons?

15:17.920 --> 15:19.210
Your Highness!

15:19.210 --> 15:20.040
Huh?

15:20.040 --> 15:21.630
I need to speak with you!

15:21.630 --> 15:23.330
Please come down here!

15:28.500 --> 15:30.960
You're eating that stuff again?

15:30.960 --> 15:33.500
They eat people.

15:33.500 --> 15:36.250
So what's wrong with me
eating them in retaliation?

15:36.250 --> 15:39.130
It is ill-mannered, Princess.

15:42.170 --> 15:44.500
Whadaya want, Major?

15:44.500 --> 15:47.040
If it's a trivial matter, I'll dismiss you.

15:47.040 --> 15:50.630
We won't have a corps if you
dismiss people for things like that.

15:51.130 --> 15:55.630
The teleportation circle we prepared
underground drew someone in.

15:55.630 --> 15:56.710
A dragon?

15:56.710 --> 15:57.790
Don't move.

15:57.790 --> 15:59.080
I don't think so.

15:59.080 --> 16:01.500
But I'd like your eyes to make
that judgement, Your Highness.

16:04.080 --> 16:05.170
Oh?

16:06.330 --> 16:08.630
What a stroke of bad luck.

16:09.290 --> 16:11.250
We were expelled from the Globe Chamber

16:11.250 --> 16:14.000
and came out of a completely different
exit than anticipated.

16:14.000 --> 16:16.000
This isn't a bad thing, per se.

16:16.000 --> 16:20.330
I prepped it for emergencies like these.

16:20.330 --> 16:22.290
The issue is the place we came out.

16:22.880 --> 16:27.380
Just the moment I wanted to quickly
get out of this country,

16:27.380 --> 16:31.210
I was captured by the most aggravating
woman in the whole kingdom, of all people.

16:36.670 --> 16:39.460
The second princess of Lese

16:37.000 --> 16:44.670
<b>Commander of the Argentum Corps</b>

16:37.000 --> 16:44.670
<b>Starlia Lese</b>

16:39.460 --> 16:43.170
and commander of the Lese Royal Army's
special troop, the Argentum Corps,

16:43.170 --> 16:44.670
Starlia Lese.

16:45.250 --> 16:47.380
Welcome to my stronghold.

16:47.380 --> 16:49.750
You don't require an introduction, do you?

16:49.750 --> 16:51.210
For it is I!

16:53.170 --> 16:54.380
Hmm?

16:54.830 --> 16:58.630
First, give me a detailed explanation
of how this came to pass, Fu.

16:58.630 --> 17:01.750
Details? I already gave you my report.

17:01.750 --> 17:07.210
We drew the magic circle, and that guy
and another guy just appeared.

17:02.250 --> 17:08.210
<b>Chief Thaumaturge of the Argentum Corps</b>

17:02.250 --> 17:08.210
<b>Fu</b>

17:07.210 --> 17:09.040
I don't know how.

17:09.040 --> 17:12.250
There's no damage to the circle,
so the mission isn't affected.

17:12.580 --> 17:15.460
It just made me feel pissed off.

17:18.540 --> 17:20.790
You poor thing!

17:20.790 --> 17:22.250
What're you laughing at?

17:22.250 --> 17:25.330
Hm? You said there was another person?

17:25.330 --> 17:26.960
Where is he?

17:26.960 --> 17:29.960
He is in critical condition
and is in no shape to talk.

17:27.460 --> 17:33.130
<b>Lese Royal Army Major & Argentum Corps Advisor</b>

17:27.460 --> 17:33.130
<b>Isaac Stern</b>

17:29.960 --> 17:33.670
We confirmed with a blood sample that
he is not a dragon, at any rate.

17:33.960 --> 17:36.170
I'm allowing him to get medical treatment.

17:36.170 --> 17:40.290
In return, the red-haired fellow
agreed to answer all our questions.

17:40.290 --> 17:41.500
Hmm.

17:42.000 --> 17:45.330
For now, I'll deal with this man first.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.670
Meat. Have some.

17:51.130 --> 17:54.080
As a token of good will, eat.

17:56.040 --> 17:57.790
Can you not eat it?

17:57.790 --> 18:01.880
Th-thank you for the snack.

18:04.000 --> 18:05.500
Is it tasty?

18:05.920 --> 18:08.420
Y-yes.

18:08.420 --> 18:10.170
Indeed, it is!

18:10.170 --> 18:12.420
That's the meat of a dragon
I hunted myself!

18:16.170 --> 18:17.790
Don't worry!

18:17.790 --> 18:19.880
It was cooked thoroughly in the sun.

18:20.710 --> 18:22.250
She's an odd duck.

18:22.920 --> 18:26.420
Starlia Lese was born with no arms.

18:26.420 --> 18:31.080
However, Starlia's eyes can sense
the aura emitted by all matter.

18:31.540 --> 18:34.170
In lieu of the arms she lacked,
she could freely control and move objects.

18:34.540 --> 18:38.170
The first thing she controlled
was a silverware set.

18:38.170 --> 18:41.380
Thus, she is called the
"Silverware Princess" by her people.

18:41.710 --> 18:43.670
Among the Solarians,

18:43.670 --> 18:46.830
she is believed to be a miracle
bestowed upon this world by their sun god.

18:46.830 --> 18:49.330
Her renown is so great that
half the world knows of her.

18:50.000 --> 18:52.750
Anecdotes about her abound.

18:52.750 --> 18:58.250
At age six, she took down
three inferior dragons.

18:59.130 --> 19:02.290
At age seven, she concealed her identity
to compete in a combat tournament...

19:02.290 --> 19:03.580
and won.

19:03.580 --> 19:08.080
At age eight, she slayed a horde of dragons,
including two medial dragons.

19:08.460 --> 19:12.710
At age nine, she prevented an
army general's attempted coup d'état.

19:13.460 --> 19:18.710
After she turned ten, she leveraged her
special talents to develop silver equipment.

19:18.710 --> 19:21.790
She swiftly became a master craftswoman.

19:22.420 --> 19:24.500
And now, at age sixteen,

19:24.500 --> 19:28.000
she commands the Argentum Corps,
a combat unit equipped with

19:28.000 --> 19:30.330
the gear she created herself.

19:30.330 --> 19:33.290
And lastly, she's now demonstrated
she's capable of slaying even Dornea,

19:33.290 --> 19:34.710
a superior dragon.

19:34.710 --> 19:38.420
But the reason I loathe this woman

19:38.420 --> 19:41.250
isn't related to her tremendous strength.

19:41.630 --> 19:43.830
I'll now begin questioning you.

19:44.250 --> 19:45.880
Answer carefully.

19:46.130 --> 19:47.750
It's because...

19:47.750 --> 19:50.460
Lies will not fool me.

19:50.460 --> 19:53.330
Deceiving this woman is
no walk in the park.

19:53.790 --> 19:58.080
Tell me who you are and how you got here.

20:02.040 --> 20:06.000
Well, I've got one second to
sort out the whole situation.

20:06.000 --> 20:09.670
The Argentum Corps is planning
to flee the country.

20:09.670 --> 20:12.500
The teleportation circle will be used
for that purpose.

20:12.500 --> 20:14.000
That's a good call.

20:14.000 --> 20:17.750
They're being pursued by
Olto Zora and Taratectra.

20:17.750 --> 20:20.130
They don't stand a chance against them.
They have no choice but to flee.

20:20.130 --> 20:21.000
Which means...

20:21.000 --> 20:23.330
Their goals and mine match up.

20:23.330 --> 20:27.000
The best outcome would be to cooperate
with them and then escape to a secure area.

20:27.000 --> 20:28.750
There isn't a second-best outcome.

20:28.750 --> 20:32.040
Any outcome that doesn't result in
escape is out of the question.

20:32.500 --> 20:33.920
The problem is...

20:34.380 --> 20:37.670
Her starlight eyes that are so highly
perceptive of aura.

20:37.670 --> 20:41.380
It's generally understood
that aura is silverine,

20:41.380 --> 20:44.540
but all life produces its own aura.

20:44.540 --> 20:46.330
The human body is not an exception to this.

20:46.750 --> 20:49.920
It's difficult to pull one over on
the Silverware Princess because

20:49.920 --> 20:53.210
she sees changes in the aura
that accompanies emotions

20:53.210 --> 20:55.580
and uses that to determine one's sincerity.

20:55.580 --> 20:58.330
That's to say, it should be
possible to trick her

20:58.330 --> 21:00.330
if I include enough truth in my little act.

21:00.710 --> 21:02.630
What a pain in the neck!

21:02.630 --> 21:04.960
How did I end up in this mess?

21:04.960 --> 21:08.000
This is totally that moron's fault!

21:08.000 --> 21:12.710
Because of him, I'm saddled with
this royal pain in my ass

21:12.710 --> 21:15.210
while he's sleeping like a baby.

21:15.210 --> 21:17.960
This is utterly unfair, damn it!

21:17.960 --> 21:19.170
Hey.

21:19.170 --> 21:20.880
I asked you a question.

21:20.880 --> 21:22.710
Why are you not responding?

21:22.710 --> 21:25.080
Should I consider your lack of
a response an answer?

21:25.080 --> 21:27.630
I-I apologize!

21:27.630 --> 21:29.380
Yikes, that was atrocious.

21:29.380 --> 21:34.170
I should know better than to squander
two whole seconds on needless thinking!

21:34.170 --> 21:37.130
But that just proved my theory.

21:37.130 --> 21:39.920
She didn't perceive my annoyance.

21:39.920 --> 21:43.290
Just as I suspected,
I can deceive her if I lie using my aura.

21:43.290 --> 21:44.500
In that case...

21:46.080 --> 21:48.460
I was uncertain if...

21:48.460 --> 21:50.580
If I should show you my eyes.

21:53.710 --> 21:54.920
His eyes!

21:54.920 --> 21:56.210
A dragon?!

21:59.000 --> 22:02.080
I am Crish Weiss, a Thaumaturge.

22:02.080 --> 22:05.750
I'll use every shred of acting talent
I have to fool Starlia's eyes!

22:06.080 --> 22:07.420
Oh?
